      "id": "P23_E1",
      "topic": "Calculus",
      "sub_topic": "Differentiation",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "question": "If y = x^3 - 4x^2 + 2x - 5, then dy/dx at x = 1 is:",
      "options": [
        "A) 5",
        "B) -3",
        "C) 3",
        "D) -1"
      ],
      "correct_option": "B",
      "explanation": "dy/dx = 3x^2 - 8x + 2. At x=1: 3(1)^2 - 8(1) + 2 = 3 - 8 + 2 = -3."
    },
    {
      "id": "P23_E2",
      "topic": "Matrices",
      "sub_topic": "Matrix Operations",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "question": "If A is a 3\u00d72 matrix and B is a 2\u00d74 matrix, then the order of AB is:",
      "options": [
        "A) 2\u00d72",
        "B) 2\u00d74",
        "C) 3\u00d74",
        "D) 4\u00d73"
      ],
      "correct_option": "C",
      "explanation": "When multiplying a 3\u00d72 matrix by a 2\u00d74 matrix, the result has order (3\u00d74)."
    },
    {
      "id": "P23_E3",
      "topic": "Probability",
      "sub_topic": "Basic Probability",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "question": "A die is rolled. The probability of getting an even number or a number greater than 4 is:",
      "options": [
        "A) 5/6",
        "B) 1/6",
        "C) 1/2",
        "D) 2/3"
      ],
      "correct_option": "D",
      "explanation": "Even numbers: {2,4,6}, Numbers > 4: {5,6}. Union = {2,4,5,6} = 4 outcomes. P = 4/6 = 2/3."
    },
    {
      "id": "P23_E4",
      "topic": "Determinants",
      "sub_topic": "Evaluation",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "question": "If A = [[3, 1], [2, 5]], then |A| equals:",
      "options": [
        "A) 11",
        "B) 15",
        "C) 13",
        "D) 17"
      ],
      "correct_option": "C",
      "explanation": "|A| = (3)(5) - (1)(2) = 15 - 2 = 13."
    },
    {
      "id": "MATH_23_05",
      "topic": "Integration",
      "sub_topic": "Indefinite Integration",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "question": "\u222b(x\u00b3 + x\u00b2 + x + 1) dx equals:",
      "options": [
        "A) x\u2074/4 + x\u00b3/3 + x\u00b2/2 + x + C",
        "B) x\u2074 + x\u00b3 + x\u00b2 + x + C",
        "C) x\u2074/4 + x\u00b3/2 + x + C",
        "D) 3x\u00b2 + 2x + 1 + C"
      ],
      "correct_option": "A",
      "explanation": "\u222bx\u00b3 dx = x\u2074/4, \u222bx\u00b2 dx = x\u00b3/3, \u222bx dx = x\u00b2/2, \u222b1 dx = x. Adding constant C gives x\u2074/4 + x\u00b3/3 + x\u00b2/2 + x + C."
    },
    {
